# Diff files are data whose bytes matter: they are generated with LF, they carry the
# blob hashes of LF content, and whatever reads them is entitled to the endings the
# generator chose. A Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true rewrites them to CRLF
# otherwise, which is how a build that was green here failed in CI.
*.patch text eol=lf
*.diff text eol=lf
